From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zhenyao Mo <zmo@chromium.org>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 09:21:28 -0700
Subject: gpu: Reset base level for ASTC compressed image uploads

Rename reset_base_level_for_astc_sub_image to
reset_base_level_for_astc_image, and apply it to
glCompressedTexImage2D and glCompressedTexImage3D in addition to
sub-image calls. For ASTC textures when base_level > 0, base_level
is reset to 0 before compressed image calls and restored afterwards to
work around a PowerVR driver bug.

Bug: 551708184
Change-Id: I29ae9c8037e160eb9d4604b0256042308156c7ed
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8303384
Reviewed-by: Kenneth Russell <kbr@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Zhenyao Mo <zmo@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1699003}

